<title>UK: SBC sets call and put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call and put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued eight million American-style call and put warrants, in 16 equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.APR.97-18.MAY.98   PAYDATE	28.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
